*> vybe-test: cobol/qualified_names_of_clause/qualified_different_pics_same_name
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_qualified_names_of_clause.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 REC-ALPHA.
   05 KEY PIC X(4) VALUE "ABCD".
01 REC-NUM.
   05 KEY PIC 9(4) VALUE 1234.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY KEY OF REC-ALPHA.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING KEY DELIMITED SIZE OF DELIMITED SIZE REC-ALPHA DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "ABCD"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [ABCD] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY KEY OF REC-NUM.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING KEY DELIMITED SIZE OF DELIMITED SIZE REC-NUM DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "1234"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [1234] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

